[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4870901127","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/120872#issuecomment-4870901127","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/120872","id":4870901127,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABIlQNhw","user":{"login":"Cyklon3000","id":67823272,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY3ODIzMjcy","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/67823272?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Cyklon3000","html_url":"https://github.com/Cyklon3000","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Cyklon3000/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Cyklon3000/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Cyklon3000/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Cyklon3000/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Cyklon3000/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Cyklon3000/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Cyklon3000/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Cyklon3000/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Cyklon3000/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-07-02T22:16:35Z","updated_at":"2026-07-02T22:16:53Z","body":"Tested in version v4.7.stable.official [5b4e0cb0f]\n - Failed to reproduce with `gl_compatability` renderer\n - Reproduces successfully with `forward_plus` and `mobile` renderer\n\n<img width=\"438\" height=\"146\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/049fd57a-94af-4ab2-8dfa-2a389d79f15a\" />\n\nSo i assume it's an bug related to Vulcan","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4870901127/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4870955039","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/120872#issuecomment-4870955039","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/120872","id":4870955039,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABIlTgHw","user":{"login":"Calinou","id":180032,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4MDAzMg==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/180032?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou","html_url":"https://github.com/Calinou","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-07-02T22:25:28Z","updated_at":"2026-07-02T22:28:58Z","body":"I can confirm this on D3D12 as well:\n\n> Godot v4.7.stable - Windows 11 (build 26100) - Multi-window, 1 monitor - Direct3D 12 (Mobile) - dedicated NVIDIA GeForce RTX 5090 (NVIDIA; 32.0.15.9649) - AMD Ryzen 9 9950X3D 16-Core Processor (32 threads) - 63.55 GiB memory - WASAPI (48000 Hz, Stereo/mono)\n\nForward+ | Mobile | Compatibility\n-|-|-\n<img width=\"1152\" height=\"648\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/af57b01c-c330-4a97-8b07-ba5dde44b1a7\" /> | <img width=\"1152\" height=\"648\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/df14aecd-02d0-4f58-a82f-bf4bbb5e657c\" /> | <img width=\"1152\" height=\"648\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/ce3e99d5-08a7-4cd8-bd8a-c571a9a3f397\" />\n\nChanging the diffuse mode on the material doesn't help, but setting Specular mode to **Toon** or **Disabled** on the material avoids the issue.\n\nWith toon specular shading:\n\nForward+ | Mobile | Compatibility\n-|-|-\n<img width=\"1152\" height=\"648\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/1f48fe0e-fc89-4e66-b370-43f623aac0f5\" /> | <img width=\"1152\" height=\"648\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/e2ab56cd-7a04-416b-87a1-2362cadd3464\" /> | <img width=\"1152\" height=\"648\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/fad074e6-1ae6-4bb3-930d-970c9ba1aa6b\" />\n\nThe issue is reproducible as far back as 4.0 using Vulkan, with the same pattern on the artifacts.","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4870955039/reactions","total_count":5,"+1":4,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":1,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4871557283","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/120872#issuecomment-4871557283","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/120872","id":4871557283,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABIl4Qow","user":{"login":"mrjustaguy","id":50302479,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUwMzAyNDc5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/50302479?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mrjustaguy","html_url":"https://github.com/mrjustaguy","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mrjustaguy/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mrjustaguy/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mrjustaguy/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mrjustaguy/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https: